et=\"utf-8\""},{"name":"Content-Transfer-Encoding","value":"8bit"}],"body":{"size":4346,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"JOIN US LIVE TODAY AT 11:00 AM ET\r\n\r\nThis presentation includes our updated 150+ \"Global Macro Outlook\" slide deck on the 3 Macro Themes that will drive market returns in the months ahead - as well as our trade, trend and tail investment positions to take advantage of the setup.\r\n\r\n📅 Date: Tuesday, February 14\r\n🕚 Time: 11:00 AM ET\r\n\r\nHere are the 3 updated themes:\r\n\r\nUSA Narrow Quad 4 to Potential/Outright Quad 1\r\n\r\nThe Big (G): Deficits & Debt Updated\r\n\r\nLong India and Gold vs. Short Japan\r\n\r\nOnly Macro Pro and Institutional subscribers get this exclusive insight into the investing outlook for the quarter before anyone else, straight from our Founder and Risk-Manager-In-Chief, Keith McCullough, and our all-star Macro team.\r\n\r\nGaining access to this flagship presentation requires an upgrade to Macro Pro from your current subscription (which you will receive a pro-rated refund on).\r\n\r\nGET ACCESS NOW:https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2024-01-12-2sg7pyd/2sgtlw7/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\nTHIS WEEK ON HEDGEYE TV\r\n\r\nKeith McCullough & Jim Rickards: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2024-02-13-2sgsrg9/2sgtlwb/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\nDaryl Jones & Doug Kass: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/es-type-macro2Cmarket-insights/2sgtlwf/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\nThe Macro Show: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ith-category-43-the-macro-show/2sgtlwj/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\nThe Call: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/h-category-71-the-call-hedgeye/2sgtlwm/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\nSubscriber Orientation: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ucation-subscriber-orientation/2sgtlwq/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\nMarket Situation Report Webcast: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ory-88-market-situation-report/2sgtlwt/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nABOUT HEDGEYE\r\n\r\nHedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process.  The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing.  \r\n\r\nThe Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, Global Technology, REITS, Industrials, Communications, Consumer Staples, Cannabis, Housing, Materials, Software, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Telecom &amp; Media, and Healthcare.\r\n\r\nUse of Hedgeye and any other products available through hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2024-02-14/2sgtlwx/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n are subject to our Terms of Service\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/2sgtlx1/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n and Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-b-/2sgtlx4/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye-/2sgtlx7/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ny-hedgeye-risk-management-llc/2sgtlxb/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye/2sgtlxf/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/us-podcast-id1216703941/2sgtlxj/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhl