br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t🕚 <strong>Time</strong>: 11:00 AM&nbsp;ET</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Here are the 3 updated themes:</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>USA Narrow Quad 4 to Potential/Outright Quad 1</strong></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>The Big (G): Deficits &amp; Debt Updated</strong></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Long India and Gold vs. Short Japan</strong></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Only<em> Macro Pro </em>and <em>Institutional</em> subscribers get this exclusive insight into the investing outlook for the quarter before anyone else, straight from our Founder and Risk-Manager-In-Chief, Keith McCullough, and our all-star Macro team.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Gaining access to this flagship presentation requires an upgrade to <em>Macro Pro</em> from your current subscription (which you will receive a pro-rated refund on).</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate !important;\" width=\"300\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#47BFED;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:22px;padding:18px 10px;border-radius:5px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:center;border:solid 1px #000000\"><strong><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2024-01-12-2sg7pyd/2sgtlw7/1590608370/h/BcDtuUoaz2lTqIhlGK9B_Hg9-mLAY929ERkQ7a_37pU\" style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\">GET ACCESS NOW</a></strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t